ometría, dimensión, y más</div>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"card card-pillar anim-in\" style=\"\">\n                <div class=\"card-pillar-num\">02</div>\n                <div class=\"card-pillar-content\">\n                  <div class=\"card-pillar-title\" data-edit=\"pillar-2-title\" contenteditable=\"\" spellcheck=\"false\">Presencia Global</div>\n                  <div class=\"card-pillar-desc\" data-edit=\"pillar-2-desc\" contenteditable=\"\" spellcheck=\"false\">centros de soporte global con expertos locales en 23 países en 6 continentes</div>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"card card-pillar anim-in\" style=\"\">\n                <div class=\"card-pillar-num\">03</div>\n                <div class=\"card-pillar-content\">\n                  <div class=\"card-pillar-title\" data-edit=\"pillar-3-title\" contenteditable=\"\" spellcheck=\"false\">Liderazgo Tecnológico</div>\n                  <div class=\"card-pillar-desc\" data-edit=\"pillar-3-desc\" contenteditable=\"\" spellcheck=\"false\">escaneo verdadero · campo brillante · campo oscuro · reflexión · espectrómetro</div>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- Panel 2 — Technologies: feature list -->\n          <div class=\"ls-tab-panel\" data-panel=\"2\">\n            <div class=\"feature-list\" style=\"margin:12px 0 0;gap:8px;\">\n              <div class=\"feature-item anim-in\" style=\"\"><div class=\"feature-num\">1</div><div class=\"feature-text\"><strong data-edit=\"tech-1-name\" contenteditable=\"\" spellcheck=\"false\">Sistema de Luz Paralela a 90°</strong><span data-edit=\"tech-1-desc\" contenteditable=\"\" spellcheck=\"false\"> — Tecnología basada en sensores que utiliza un haz de luz paralela a 90° para detectar defectos de superficie.</span></div></div>\n              <div class=\"feature-item anim-in\" style=\"\"><div class=\"feature-num\">2</div><div class=\"feature-text\"><strong data-edit=\"tech-2-name\" contenteditable=\"\" spellcheck=\"false\">Campo Brillante y Campo Oscuro</strong><span data-edit=\"tech-2-desc\" contenteditable=\"\" spellcheck=\"false\"> — Tecnología basada en cámara que combina ambos modos de iluminación.</span></div></div>\n              <div class=\"feature-item anim-in\" style=\"\"><div class=\"feature-num\">3</div><div class=\"feature-text\"><strong data-edit=\"tech-3-name\" contenteditable=\"\" spellcheck=\"false\">Tecnología de Reflexión</strong><span data-edit=\"tech-3-desc\" contenteditable=\"\" spellcheck=\"false\"> — Tecnología de sensor y luz parásita utilizando principios de reflexión.</span></div></div>\n              <div class=\"feature-item anim-in\" style=\"\"><div class=\"feature-num\">4</div><div class=\"feature-text\"><strong data-edit=\"tech-4-name\" contenteditable=\"\" spellcheck=\"false\">Espectrómetro</strong><span data-edit=\"tech-4-desc\" contenteditable=\"\" spellcheck=\"false\"> — Tecnología de sensor con filtro polarizado para análisis espectral.</span></div></div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- Panel 3 — Global Network: a single uploadable map image (simplified from the old pin map) -->\n          <div class=\"ls-tab-panel\" data-panel=\"3\">\n            <div class=\"card template02-company-map\" data-edit=\"map-image\" data-edit-type=\"image\" title=\"Click to change the map image\">\n              <img class=\"template02-company-map-img\" src=\"/slides/uploads/World-Map-of-locations-.jpeg\" alt=\"Global network map\" onerror=\"this.classList.add('template02-company-map-img--missing')\">\n              <label class=\"template02-company-map-placeholder\">\n                <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">\n                  <rect x=\"3\" y=\"3\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" rx=\"3\"></rect>\n                  <circle cx=\"8.5\" cy=\"8.5\" r=\"1.5\"></circle>\n                  <polyline points=\"21 15 16 10 5 21\"></polyline>\n                </svg>\n                <span>Network Map</span>\n                <small>Click to upload</small>\n              </label>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- Panel 4 — IQC Group: brand cards -->\n          <div class=\"ls-tab-panel active\" data-panel=\"4\">\n            <div class=\"template02-company-iqc\">\n              <div class=\"card card-iqc\"><img src=\"/slides/shared/LOGO SoftSolution grays.png\" alt=\"Softsolution\" class=\"card-iqc-logo\"><div class=\"card-iqc-country\">Austria</div><ul class=\"card-iqc-products\"><li>LineScanner</li><li>BowScanner</li><li>CulletScanner</li><li>VirtualDigitizing</li></ul></div>\n              <div class=\"card card-iqc\"><img src=\"/slides/shared/LOGO LiteSentry Greys.png\" alt=\"LiteSentry\" class=\"card-iqc-logo\"><div class=\"card-iqc-country\">United States</div><ul class=\"card-iqc-products\"><li>Osprey® 25 Distortion Inspection</li><li>Osprey® 25 Anisotropy Inspection</li><li>Owl – Furnace Control</li><li>LoadValidator</li><li>TS 4000 Thickness &amp; Coating Sensor</li></ul></div>\n              <div class=\"card card-iqc\"><img src=\"/slides/shared/LOGO StrainOptics.png\" alt=\"Strainoptics\" class=\"card-iqc-logo\" style=\"transform:scale(1.3);\"><div class=\"card-iqc-country\">United States</div><ul class=\"card-iqc-products\"><li>GASP</li><li>Polarimeter</li></ul></div>\n              <div class=\"card card-iqc\"><img src=\"/slides/shared/LOGO AVALON.png\" alt=\"Avalon Vision\" class=\"card-iqc-logo\"><div class=\"card-iqc-country\">United States</div><ul class=\"card-iqc-products\"><li>MoldWatcher</li><li>ThermalWatch</li><li>NightHawk</li><li>QualityStation</li></ul></div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n        </div><!-- /.ls-tab-panels -->\n      ",
